msgstr "متى *لا* تستخدم البوابات الكسرية {#when-not-to-use-fractional-gates}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "It is important to note that fractional gates are an *experimental* feature and the behavior of the `use_fractional_gates` flag may change in the future. Look to the [release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) for new versions of Qiskit Runtime for more information. See also the API reference documentation for [QiskitRuntimeService.backend](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend), which describes `use_fractional_gates`.\n"
